ic adventure you could ever imagine. Fight all your enemies and immerse in the story to fully embrace the world!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194810/extras/6e3ec9a603b12c959c96f138643b6be9.poster.avif?t=1728938652\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194810/extras/6e3ec9a603b12c959c96f138643b6be9.webm?t=1728938652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2194810/extras/6e3ec9a603b12c959c96f138643b6be9.mp4?t=1728938652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>All characters are over 18 years old</strong>",
